; Pako Setup's English text: Tauri's own English file (tauri-cli 2.12) with plainer wording for
; closing Pako, for replacing an older version (installer/installer.nsi then only removes the old
; files, see "[Pako]" there) and for the uninstaller's "delete data" box. Tauri needs every
; string it uses here: after a tauri-cli update, compare with its English.nsh and add any new one.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add/Reinstall components"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Already Installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open. Close it first, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open.$\nClick OK to close it and continue."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose the maintenance option to perform."
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how you want to install ${PRODUCTNAME}."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Create desktop shortcut"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall (Downgrading without uninstall is disabled for this installer)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't close {{product_name}}. Close it first, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is already installed! It is not recommended that you install an older version. If you really want to install this older version, it's better to uninstall the current version first. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed. Pako Setup replaces it: your settings, lists, shortcuts and taskbar pin stay. Click Next to continue."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downgrades are disabled for this installer, can't proceed with the silent installer, please use the graphical interface installer instead.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Unable to uninstall!"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Replace the installed version (recommended)"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Failed to install WebView2! The app can't run without it. Try restarting the installer."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Error: Downloading WebView2 Failed - $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 bootstrapper downloaded successfully"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading WebView2 bootstrapper..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Error: Installing WebView2 failed with exit code $1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 installed successfully"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete Pako's settings and lists"
; [Pako] A silent or passive install's folder check (installer/hooks.nsh: PakoCheckDir).
LangString pakoDirNotWritable ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako Setup installs Pako for you only, without admin rights, so it needs a folder you can change. Windows doesn't let you change $INSTDIR (folders like Program Files need admin rights).$\n$\nPick another folder, for example $LOCALAPPDATA\Programs\Pako."
LangString pakoDirNotWritableSilent ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako Setup installs Pako for you only, without admin rights, so it needs a folder you can change. Windows doesn't let you change $INSTDIR (folders like Program Files need admin rights). Pick another folder with /D=, for example /D=$LOCALAPPDATA\Programs\Pako$\n"
; [Pako] Pako Setup's own window (installer/ui.nsh). Plain words, the window's exact labels.
LangString pakoVersion ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Version ${VERSION}"
LangString pakoTag ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloads, uploads and Direct, on your PC"
LangString pakoTagUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Updates Pako $PakoOldVersion to ${VERSION}"
LangString pakoTagSame ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako ${VERSION} is installed: this installs it again"
LangString pakoTagOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Puts back Pako ${VERSION} (you have $PakoOldVersion)"
LangString pakoUpdateTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Update Pako"
LangString pakoInstallIn ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install in"
LangString pakoChange ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Change"
LangString pakoPickFolder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pick where to install Pako. Pako gets a folder of its own in it."
LangString pakoDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Desktop shortcut"
LangString pakoStartWithWindows ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Start Pako with Windows"
LangString pakoBrowsers ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Connect Pako to your browsers"
LangString pakoBrowsersSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "So the browser extension can talk to Pako"
LangString pakoTermsA ${LANG_ENGLISH} "By installing, you accept the "
LangString pakoTermsAUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "By updating, you accept the "
LangString pakoTermsLink ${LANG_ENGLISH} "terms of use"
LangString pakoTermsB ${LANG_ENGLISH} "."
LangString pakoNoAdmin ${LANG_ENGLISH} "No admin rights needed."
LangString pakoFolderAdmin ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Windows only lets admins change this folder, so Pako couldn't update itself there. Pick a folder of yours."
LangString pakoFolderWrite ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Windows doesn't let you change this folder. Pick a folder of yours."
LangString pakoFolderMissing ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This drive or network folder can't be reached. Pick another folder."
LangString pakoFolderLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This folder's path is too long for Windows. Pick a shorter one."
LangString pakoMoveHint ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Click Change: Pako moves to the folder you pick, and your settings and lists stay."
LangString pakoMoveNote ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako moves to this folder. Your settings and lists stay."
LangString pakoChangeName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Change folder"
LangString pakoOpenName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open Pako"
LangString pakoPrevSlide ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Previous slide"
LangString pakoNextSlide ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Next slide"
LangString pakoChoicesFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Start with Windows and the browser connection couldn't be set. Turn them on in Pako: Settings › Window and Settings › Browser extension."
LangString pakoFailInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't finish installing: Windows didn't allow writing in $INSTDIR."
LangString pakoFailFile ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't replace $PakoFailName: another program may be using it. Close it, then run Pako Setup again."
LangString pakoFolderData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako keeps its settings and lists in this folder. Pick another one."
LangString pakoFolderPortable ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A portable Pako is in this folder. Pick another one, so its lists stay with it."
LangString pakoFolderPick ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pick a folder to install Pako in."
LangString pakoIsOpen ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako is open: Setup closes it first. Your downloads pick up where they stopped when it starts again."
LangString pakoInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Pako…"
LangString pakoUpdating ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Updating Pako…"
LangString pakoInstallingAgain ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Pako again…"
LangString pakoInstallingOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Pako ${VERSION}…"
LangString pakoDone ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako is installed"
LangString pakoDoneUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako is up to date"
LangString pakoDoneAgain ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako is installed again"
LangString pakoDoneOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako ${VERSION} is installed"
LangString pakoDoneWhere ${LANG_ENGLISH} "You'll find it in the Start menu."
LangString pakoDoneWhereDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "You'll find it in the Start menu and on your desktop."
LangString pakoClose ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Close"
LangString pakoUnTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall Pako"
LangString pakoUnText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako will be removed from this PC. The files you downloaded stay where they are."
LangString pakoUnDataSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Your lists, contacts and settings. Downloaded files stay."
LangString pakoUnPrivate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete Private mode's files"
LangString pakoUnPrivateSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Your encrypted private downloads. This can't be undone."
LangString pakoRemoving ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Removing Pako…"
LangString pakoUnDone ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pako is uninstalled"
LangString pakoUnDoneText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The files you downloaded are still where you saved them."
; [Pako] The line under the progress bar while Pako.exe is copied: "Copying Pako.exe... 40%".
LangString ^Extract ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Copying "
